	<h3>Geometric resolution for Implicit Systems of Differential Algebraic Equations</h3>
	<div><em>Pablo Solerno</em></div>
	<br />

	<blockquote>
							Last modified:&nbsp;2010-06-03<br/>
	</blockquote>

		<h4>Abstract</h4>
	<br />
	<div>Given a square implicit DAE system, we construct<br />by means an algorithm of controlled complexity an equivalent system<br />which consists simply in a vector field over an algebraic hypersurface<br />(a so-called, semi-explicit DAE system).<br />The procedure is based on the computation of a geometric resolution "a<br />la Kronecker" of a suitable algebraic variety in a jet space associated<br />to the input DAE system.<br />(A joint work with L. D'Alfonso, G. Jeronimo, F. Ollivier et A. Sedoglavic)<br /></div>
	<br />
	
						

